{"id":7322,"chapter_id":7,"scene_id":715,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"两个“赫卡蒂”的幻影一起消散，重归到地下。苦痛编织的幻境中只剩她一个人，她找不到那个声音的主人。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……你是谁？为什么会知道……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7162002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我只是听到了你的心。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7162003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"？？？","content":"去吧……你的感情已经困不住你了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7162004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"幻境开始破碎，隔着赫卡蒂和${PlayerName}的无形的墙正在消失。促使自己行动的是什么，这么做又是对还是错，也许有一天她能找到答案，但不必是现在。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"现在，她只想尽快回到${PlayerName}身边。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1}]}